            <div xml:id="d491">

                <pb facs="0415" n="403" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg403"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.24/47: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Liberia</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Hibbard</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-12-10T18:00:00-04:00">December 10,
                            1942—6 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>317. Your 401, December 4. No questions were asked by the newspaper
                    correspondents at the time of the issuance of the press release and no special
                    statement was made.</p>
                <p>We are giving consideration to your suggestion with regard to a personal message
                    from President Roosevelt to President Barclay.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
